{"steam_appid":2938870,"steam_name":"Maseylia : Echoes of the Past","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2938870/1708278430/70dea8d773567a381d59962c68c7f34c3cc053fe/1779905229/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1779905857","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257050555/1d9f2468ed4f9ca152777546db6aec4b1c9bf01b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1779905857","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/6eef729535c46b7e5f5018e8badd35d3b7df5b0c/ss_6eef729535c46b7e5f5018e8badd35d3b7df5b0c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785148953","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/15ec6968203f278e2360200cb2336a08f1cd2ff5/ss_15ec6968203f278e2360200cb2336a08f1cd2ff5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785148953","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/ff0d30b471946fb3d649b25832957a5c5dd5bc3f/ss_ff0d30b471946fb3d649b25832957a5c5dd5bc3f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785148953","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/d12496110830e70bab27996ef7219f1cf3332b16/ss_d12496110830e70bab27996ef7219f1cf3332b16.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785148953","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/cb79246d34fdfb9515bd8e3e35afee3a6afcdbf1/ss_cb79246d34fdfb9515bd8e3e35afee3a6afcdbf1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785148953"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a vast interconnected world. Master fluid movement. Become one with Maseylia.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maseylia: Echoes of the Past</strong> is a <strong>true 3D Metroidvania</strong> built around freedom of movement, deep exploration, and atmospheric discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a fully interconnected three-dimensional world, every new ability dramatically transforms how you traverse the environment — opening hidden paths, enabling sequence breaking, and rewarding curiosity at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/1101508495ac62b65ae00309c40d7593.poster.avif?t=1785148953\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/1101508495ac62b65ae00309c40d7593.webm?t=1785148953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/1101508495ac62b65ae00309c40d7593.mp4?t=1785148953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Key Features</strong></i></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>True 3D Non-Linear Exploration</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast, vertically rich world filled with ancient ruins, forgotten cities, alien forests, and surreal techno-organic structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/d459f08ca20e55640d35e211683ef2dd.poster.avif?t=1785148953\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/d459f08ca20e55640d35e211683ef2dd.webm?t=1785148953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/d459f08ca20e55640d35e211683ef2dd.mp4?t=1785148953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exceptional Movement Freedom </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fluid traversal abilities including Double jump, 360° air dash,  Grapple and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/05b8ad913cfcac376728cd509b98a903.poster.avif?t=1785148953\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/05b8ad913cfcac376728cd509b98a903.webm?t=1785148953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/05b8ad913cfcac376728cd509b98a903.mp4?t=1785148953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ability-Driven Progression</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New powers don’t just unlock doors — they fundamentally reshape how you move and interact with the world, allowing you to revisit old areas in entirely new ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moebius-Inspired Sci-Fi Art Direction</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a breathtaking universe where nature and ancient technology merge into surreal, living landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/754747b26996382b4722650ea5c314c7.poster.avif?t=1785148953\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/754747b26996382b4722650ea5c314c7.webm?t=1785148953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/754747b26996382b4722650ea5c314c7.mp4?t=1785148953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling &amp; Deep Lore</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the tragic history of Maseylia through exploration, ruins, and forgotten remnants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/711dd5b3b2976d65abbd2af2df6ca5d0.poster.avif?t=1785148953\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/711dd5b3b2976d65abbd2af2df6ca5d0.webm?t=1785148953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/711dd5b3b2976d65abbd2af2df6ca5d0.mp4?t=1785148953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Movement-Based Combat &amp; Epic Bosses</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face hostile creatures and towering guardians in fluid, mobility-focused battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/5793fa9c78b03aa5c0929734cbfd8810.poster.avif?t=1785148953\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/5793fa9c78b03aa5c0929734cbfd8810.webm?t=1785148953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938870/extras/5793fa9c78b03aa5c0929734cbfd8810.mp4?t=1785148953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by Metroid Prime, Pseudoregalia, and Hollow Knight but fully reimagined in true 3D.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you uncover the secrets of the Heart of Maseylia?</strong></h2>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Sol Brothers"],"publishers":["Sol Brothers"],"release_date":"Jun 19, 2026"}